      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CALYPSO ETHICS (1) showed strong early pace from the wide draw and stuck on well despite missing the frame, finishing fifth over 515m Gosford in 29.80. Has a strong record out of this box with five wins and three minor placings from 10 starts. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. SIR TICK (6) ran below best last time finishing fourth (23.16) over 400m at The Gardens from Box 3. Should be in this for a long way. BRING ON BLING (8) doesn't win out of turn. Finished third (18.20) at Richmond Straight latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Solid record at the distance winning six races. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and six minor placings to her credit. Expected to be in the finish again. FIRE UP FROG (2) is worth consideration.",
